--- spec_drift check help ---
usage: spec_drift.py check [-h] [--phase PHASE] [--logs-dir LOGS_DIR]
                           [--before BEFORE] [--after AFTER] [-o OUTPUT]
                           [--json]
                           module

positional arguments:
  module                Module name (e.g. volume_impl)

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --phase PHASE         Phase to check (default: current phase from pipeline
                        state)
  --logs-dir LOGS_DIR   Logs directory
  --before BEFORE       Override baseline git ref (instead of auto-detect)
  --after AFTER         Git ref for current state
  -o OUTPUT, --output OUTPUT
                        Output report file
  --json                JSON output
--- ast_consistency report help ---
usage: ast_consistency.py [source] verus report [-h] -o OUTPUT [--json]

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  -o OUTPUT, --output OUTPUT
                        Output directory for diffs and reports.
  --json                Also write JSON report.
--- operator_decisions gate help ---
usage: operator_decisions gate [-h]

options:
  -h, --help  show this help message and exit
